cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EOChrono in research, please cite the software and the associated Software Impacts article when available."
title: "EOChrono: Satellite Image Discovery and Temporal Scene Selection in QGIS"
type: software
version: "7.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/abotalebmostafa11/EOChrono"
url: "https://github.com/abotalebmostafa11/EOChrono"
abstract: >-
  EOChrono is a QGIS plugin for satellite-image discovery, quality-aware
  ranking, temporal scene selection, download tracking, local acquisition
  records and raster-processing operations for Earth observation workflows.
keywords:
  - QGIS
  - Earth observation
  - satellite imagery
  - temporal sampling
  - STAC
  - Sentinel
  - Landsat
  - MODIS
